{"accepted_at":"2026-11-12T21:42:41+08:00","basis_report_path":"research/companies/HK/00700/reports/2026-H1.md","financial_basis":{"period_end":"2026-06-30","published_on":"2026-08-12","source_url":"https://www.tencent.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/E700_IRA.pdf"},"information_cutoff":"2026-11-12T20:30:00+08:00","key_logic":["微信关系、交易与广告反馈相互加强，营销服务高于主要可比平台的增长支持变现能力，预测仍保留推理及内容成本。","长青游戏与新产品接续提供现金，国际业务波动说明产品周期仍在，增值服务预测增速与毛利逐渐放缓。","五年设备现金预算9150亿元，并保留内容、租赁、净预付款及股份薪酬，现金恢复依赖经营利润增长与初期预付款压力减轻。"],"last_research_at":"2026-11-12T21:42:41+08:00","name":"腾讯控股","report_period":"2026-H1","return_model":{"base_case_distributions_per_share":[6.0209,6.6614,7.4301,8.3268,9.2235],"base_case_terminal_equity_value_range_per_share":{"year_5":{"high":672.035,"low":572.1825}},"currency":"HKD","method":"annual_common_equity_irr_v1","model_as_of":"2026-11-12T20:30:00+08:00","schema_version":1},"return_model_note":"五年总普通股股息470、520、580、650、720亿元，按91.8亿完全稀释股和1人民币=1.176港元换算。股份薪酬保留在费用并预算等额回购抵消新增稀释，不把回购列为持有人现金。第五年经营价值32562—39482亿元，加已扣五年分红后的普通股净现金6284.54亿元、减350亿元经营缓冲，加投资资产6168.59—7043.69亿元，形成572.1825—672.035港元终值。投资分红与本金分开、少数权益扣除，母公司储备、到账与回购现金同步约束。","risks":["AI资本强度及服务成本永久上升，新产品和广告增量不能覆盖必要投入。","社交交易入口或游戏用户迁移，使既有网络与长青产品的现金优势减弱。","新增算力合同期限、海外交付及退款不明，母公司上划与普通股回收依赖法律权利和资本配置。"],"schema_version":6,"security_basis":{"currency":"HKD","ordinary_shares_per_unit":1,"source_url":"https://www.tencent.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/e_THL_monthly-return-October-2026.pdf","unit":"ordinary_share"},"source_urls":["https://www.tencent.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/E700_IRA.pdf","https://www.tencent.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/E700_BM.pdf","https://stockanalysis.com/quote/hkg/0700/history/","https://www.tencent.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/E700_IR.pdf","https://ir.kuaishou.com/news-releases/news-release-details/kuaishou-technology-announces-second-quarter-and-interim-2026","https://www.prnewswire.com/apac/news-releases/tencent-announces-2025-annual-and-fourth-quarter-results-302717280.html","https://www.tencent.com